  ],
  "notes": "Primarschule has 5 Schulstufen; Ober- and Realschule have 4 (Sekundarstufe I). The Gymnasium long form (7 years) follows the 5th Primarschule year: its Unterstufe (classes 1–3) is Sekundarstufe I and its Oberstufe (classes 4–7) is Sekundarstufe II, so a Gymnasium learner is in Sekundarstufe II from year 9; the short form (4 years) follows the 3rd Realschule year. Apprenticeships and the Berufsmittelschule are the other upper-secondary routes. A voluntary 10th school year is not listed."
}
